# Making the Grade (windurst 4): Koru-Moru's and Fuepepe's other arms, by GM. Accepted at Prog 0, a level-10 WAR,
# Teacher's Pet completed, fame 125. Koru-Moru: no sheets held: nil (193); the sheets held: 287; the sheets traded at
# Prog 0: 287 (not Prog 1); at Prog 2 (GM, with the Tattered Test Sheet): the trade 287, the talk 286. Fuepepe at Prog 2
# (before Chomoro-Kyotoro's 460): 458: completed (kept quirk: the Tattered Test Sheet stays). Fuepepe at Prog -1 (GM,
# available, then accepted again): no arm, nil (423).
lists WindurstWalls/Koru-Moru/onTrigger WindurstWalls/Koru-Moru/onTrade WindurstWaters/Fuepepe/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/458
char zone=WindurstWalls pos=-119.7,-5.5,122.4 job=WAR lvl=10
quest Windurst.TeachersPet completed
